<title>CANADA: DBRS confirms Brookfield Homes on merger.</title>
<headline>DBRS confirms Brookfield Homes on merger.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dominion Bond Rating Service said it confirmed the senior debt ratings for Brookfield Homes at BB after its majority owner, Brookfield Properties Corp proposed a share exchange amalgamation.</p>
<p>DBRS said it also rated Brookfield Homes unsecured debentures at B and preferred shares at Pfd-5. It said all the ratings were given a stable trend outlook.</p>
<p>The Toronto-based rating agency said the confirmation was given after Brookfield Properties proposed a share exchange merger with Brookfield Homes on the basis of one share of Properties for 1.5 shares of Homes.</p>
<p>Brookfield Properties owns 96 percent of Brookfield Homes.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100))</p>
